  "description": "PUWHIZ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C72 H144 Dy4 Mn4 N8 O40,1.6(C2 H3 N1),1.4(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Mn1 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn2 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn3 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn4 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.356-3.956 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.33-116.08°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C72H144Dy4Mn4N8O40·1.6(C2H3N)·1.4(C7H8). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)). Article name explicitly identifies Mn(III), Dy(III).",
